      "id": "COL-AIML-CODING-042",
      "originalTitle": "The task at hand is to assign a label of 1 to words in a sentence that correspond with a LOCATION, and a label of 0 to everything else. \n\nIn this simplified example, we only ever see spans of length 1.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/alirezadir/AIMLInterviews/blob/9ee330857b953e6e95376a901f8b12cd89bd2234/src/MLC/notebooks/ww_classifier.ipynb",
